          "content": "---\npdac-scope: cited\n---\n\n# Proposal\n\n## Why\nCharacterize the existing summary rules with additional primitive status cases.\n<!-- pdac:cite id=\"FR-SUMMARY-001\" digest=\"sha256:d422a7f0e7294b9ffbb099871260c2ac5c287609036e808fc160786f294971ac\" -->\n<!-- pdac:cite id=\"BR-SUMMARY-001\" digest=\"sha256:a21b966ff4747da8ee35ee1366ffeac16f6a6fa3da508ca04d3f0b31380677c4\" -->\n\n## What Changes\n- Append numeric and boolean classification tests; preserve production code and all existing assertions.\n\n## Capabilities\n### New Capabilities\n- `summary-characterization`: Verification of existing summary behavior.\n### Modified Capabilities\nNone.\n\n## Impact\nOnly src/summary.test.mjs and this plan. No product-model changes.\n"
