        {
          "path": "openspec/changes/issue-54-proposal/design.md",
          "content": "---\npdac-scope: cited\n---\n\n# Design\n\nUse a frozen mixed inventory with exact literal expected counters, preserving scalar values, identity and nested contents.\n<!-- pdac:cite id=\"FR-SUMMARY-001\" digest=\"sha256:d422a7f0e7294b9ffbb099871260c2ac5c287609036e808fc160786f294971ac\" -->\n<!-- pdac:cite id=\"BR-SUMMARY-001\" digest=\"sha256:a21b966ff4747da8ee35ee1366ffeac16f6a6fa3da508ca04d3f0b31380677c4\" -->\n\nRun the declared independent checks before review. Roll back only the added test and this plan.\n"
