          "content": "---\npdac-scope: cited\n---\n\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing summary classification\nThe summary SHALL count only exact primitive passed and failed strings and classify all other statuses as unavailable. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. Preserve existing input observations and the accepted four-counter result without adding any new product behavior. \n<!-- pdac:cite id=\"FR-SUMMARY-001\" digest=\"sha256:d422a7f0e7294b9ffbb099871260c2ac5c287609036e808fc160786f294971ac\" -->\n<!-- pdac:cite id=\"BR-SUMMARY-001\" digest=\"sha256:a21b966ff4747da8ee35ee1366ffeac16f6a6fa3da508ca04d3f0b31380677c4\" -->\n\n#### Scenario: Other primitive statuses\n- **WHEN** numeric and boolean status observations are mixed with primitive passed and failed controls\n- **THEN** only the two recognized controls are counted as passed or failed and all other statuses are unavailable\n"
